{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a full-screen "destination hero slider" block. Build an exact static layout first.
    
    OVERALL
    - Full-bleed: width 100vw (break out of any page-width container with margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw)), height 100svh, min-height 640px, position relative, overflow hidden, background #111.
    - Scope all markup, CSS and JS to a wrapper with a unique id based on block.id, so multiple instances never clash. Use plain CSS and vanilla JS only, no libraries.
    - Accent colour setting (default #ECAB32). All text is white.
    
    LAYER 1 — BACKGROUND
    - The active slide's image covers the whole block (object-fit: cover).
    - Three overlays on top of it: (a) flat black at the "overlay opacity" setting (default 25%); (b) a left-to-right gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.40) to transparent at 55%, for text legibility; (c) a top gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.35) to transparent at 20%, so a transparent theme header stays readable.
    
    LAYER 2 — TOP AUTOPLAY BAR
    - A 3px bar pinned to the very top edge. The track is transparent and the fill uses the accent colour. Start the fill at 0% width (Part 2 animates it).
    
    LAYER 3 — LEFT CONTENT (active slide)
    Left padding 5vw. Absolutely positioned: the top sits at 35% of the section height, and the bottom of the button row lines up with the bottom edge of the cards (about 82% of the height). Stack, in order:
    1. A white dash, 20px × 3px, with 18px space below.
    2. The location eyebrow (e.g. "Switzerland Alps"): body font, clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 22px), weight 300, inside an overflow:hidden mask, with 14px space below.
    3. A two-line title. Put each line in its own span inside its own overflow:hidden mask (Part 2 needs this). Use the display font, UPPERCASE, tall condensed bold (default Oswald 700, font_picker handle oswald_n7), font-size clamp(52px, 7.2vw, 112px), line-height 1.02.
    4. A description: 14px, line-height 1.75, white at 75% opacity, max-width 390px, margin 18px 0 28px.
    5. A button row, gap 16px, vertically centred:
       - Bookmark: a 38px circle filled with the accent colour, holding a white 14px bookmark SVG. Clicking it toggles a "saved" state (icon filled or outlined), client-side only.
       - A "DISCOVER LOCATION" pill: 40px tall, padding 0 28px, transparent, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), radius 999px, 11px uppercase, letter-spacing .12em, weight 500. On hover: white background, dark text. It links to the slide's button link., LAYER 4 — CARD TRACK (upcoming slides)
    - Positioned left: 41% and top: 42%. It runs off the right edge and the last visible card is cut off by the screen edge. That is intended.
    - Show every slide except the active one, in order after it, looping. Active 1 → cards 2,3,4,5,6. Active 3 → cards 4,5,6,1,2.
    - Each card is a <button>: width clamp(170px, 14.6vw, 240px), aspect-ratio 13/20, gap 1.9vw, border-radius 10px, overflow hidden, box-shadow 0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35). Image object-fit cover. Bottom overlay gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.65) to transparent at 55%.
    - Card text sits bottom-left with padding 0 16px 20px: a 12px × 2px white dash; the location at 12px, white 85%; the title on 2 lines, UPPERCASE display font, 21px, line-height 1.05.
    - On hover: translateY(-6px) and a deeper shadow, over 300ms.
    
    LAYER 5 — CONTROLS ROW
    - Vertical centre at 91% of the height. The left edge lines up with the first card (41%); the right edge is 4vw from the screen edge.
    - Prev and next arrows: 60px circles, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent, thin white chevron SVGs, gap 12px. On hover: white border and background rgba(255,255,255,.1).
    - A progress line fills the space between the arrows and the counter (margin 0 24px): a 1px line in rgba(255,255,255,.35) with a 2px accent fill on top. Fill width = activeIndex ÷ totalSlides, so slide 1 = 0% and slide 2 = 16.7% when there are 6 slides.
    - A counter on the right showing two digits ("01"): display font, clamp(36px, 3.6vw, 56px), inside an overflow:hidden box one line tall.
    
    SETTINGS
    Global: accent colour; display font (font_picker, default oswald_n7); overlay opacity (range 0–80, default 25); autoplay (checkbox, on); autoplay seconds (range 3–12, default 6); pause on hover (checkbox, on).
    Slides: 6 fixed groups with a header for each ("Slide 1" to "Slide 6"). Each group has: image (image_picker), location (text), title line 1 (text), title line 2 (text), description (textarea), button label (text, default "Discover location"), button link (url). Skip any slide without a title, so the block works with 2 to 6 slides. If a slide has no image, use a Shopify placeholder SVG on dark grey., DEMO CONTENT (defaults)
    1. Switzerland Alps — SAINT / ANTÖNIEN
    2. Japan Alps — NAGANO / PREFECTURE
    3. Sahara Desert - Morocco — MARRAKECH / MERZOUGA
    4. Sierra Nevada - United States — YOSEMITE / NATIONAL PARK
    5. Tarifa - Spain — LOS LANCES / BEACH
    6. Cappadocia - Turkey — GÖREME / VALLEY
    Use this description on all six: "Mauris malesuada nisi sit amet augue accumsan tincidunt. Maecenas tincidunt, velit ac porttitor pulvinar, tortor eros facilisis libero."
    
    RESPONSIVE
    - ≤1024px: cards clamp(150px, 18vw, 190px); the track starts at left 46%.
    - ≤749px: content top at 18%; title clamp(40px, 11vw, 56px); description max-width 90%. The card track moves under the content (left 5vw, bottom 120px), cards are 132px wide with a 12px gap, and the row scrolls horizontally with scroll-snap. The controls row sits at bottom 32px with 5vw side padding; arrows are 48px and the counter is 32px.
    
    IMAGES
    Each slide has one image, used for both its background and its card. Use image_url + image_tag with srcset (backgrounds up to 2400w, cards up to 600w). Load slide 1's background eagerly with fetchpriority="high". Lazy-load everything else.
    
    Render slide 1 as active. Prev, next and card clicks only need to swap content for now. , STATE
    - Track a single activeIndex and loop infinitely.
    - "Next" makes the first card the active slide. Clicking any card makes that card's slide active, and the expansion starts from that card's position.
    - Ignore input while a transition runs (about 1.3s).
    
    NEXT / CARD-CLICK TRANSITION (about 1.2s; easing cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1) unless stated)
    1. 0ms — The clicked card scales to 1.04 over 150ms.
    2. 0–650ms — The card grows into the new background:
       - Place a full-size layer holding the new slide's background image above the old background.
       - Start it with clip-path: inset(...) that matches the card's exact rect, measured with getBoundingClientRect relative to the section, with a 10px radius.
       - Animate the clip-path to inset(0 round 0). The image keeps its final full-screen framing and is revealed through a growing window. It also scales from 1.1 to 1.
       - Hide the real card the moment this starts.
    3. 0–650ms — The old scene darkens: the old background goes to filter: brightness(.25), and the old left text fades to 20% opacity in place without moving. A dark frame stays visible around the growing image.
    4. 650ms — The new image becomes the real background and the layer is removed. Swap in the new slide's text, hidden and ready to reveal.
    5. 60–750ms — The cards shift left by one slot, each lagging 80ms behind the card before it. The gaps briefly widen, then close up; this elastic-gap look is important. Each card moves for 600ms with cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1). The slide that just left the background is added as the last card: it fades in from translateX(40px), opacity 0 → 1, over 400ms, after the others settle.
    6. From 550ms — Text reveal: each element starts 90ms after the previous one and runs 600ms with cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1):
       - dash: scaleX 0 → 1, transform-origin left
       - eyebrow: translateY(105%) → 0 inside its mask
       - title line 1, then title line 2: translateY(105%) → 0 inside their masks, so the letters rise up from a hidden baseline
       - description: translateY(14px) → 0, opacity 0 → 1
       - button row: translateY(14px) → 0, opacity 0 → 1
    7. From 300ms — The counter rolls up: the old number goes from translateY(0) to -100% while the new one comes up from 100% to 0, both over 450ms.
    8. From 300ms — The progress line's accent fill animates to activeIndex ÷ total over 600ms., PREV TRANSITION (mirror of Next)
    - The current background shrinks back into a card at the first card slot: clip-path goes from inset(0) to that slot's rect over 650ms. The previous slide's image sits underneath and brightens from .25 to 1.
    - The cards shift right by one slot with the same 80ms lag between cards. The last card fades out to the right.
    - Use the same text reveal. The counter rolls downward instead.
    
    AUTOPLAY + TOP BAR
    - When autoplay is on, the 3px top bar grows linearly from 0 to 100% over "autoplay seconds". At 100%, trigger Next. Reset the bar to 0 instantly and restart it once the transition ends.
    - Pause when the slider is hovered (if that setting is on), when the tab is hidden (visibilitychange), and when the section is off-screen (IntersectionObserver). While paused, the bar freezes and later resumes from where it stopped. Drive it with requestAnimationFrame and elapsed time.
    - Any manual navigation resets the bar.
    
    INPUT
    - Prev and next buttons, card clicks, the ←/→ keys when the slider is focused, and a horizontal swipe on the background (50px threshold).
    - ≤749px: after each change, smooth-scroll the card row back to the start.
    
    FIRST LOAD
    The background fades in while scaling from 1.08 to 1 over 1.2s. Then the text reveal runs once, and the cards fade up from translateY(30px), each 80ms after the previous one.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign uid = block.id | remove: '_' | downcase %}
{% style %}
#ds-{{uid}}{display:block;position:relative;width:100%;height:100svh;min-height:640px;overflow:hidden;background:#111;color:#fff}#ds-{{uid}} .bg,#ds-{{uid}} .grow{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#ds-{{uid}} .grow{z-index:8;clip-path:inset(var(--t) var(--r) var(--b) var(--l) round 10px);transform:scale(1.1);transition:clip-path 650ms cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1),transform 650ms cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1)}#ds-{{uid}} .grow.open{clip-path:inset(0 round 0);transform:scale(1)}#ds-{{uid}} .shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);z-index:1}#ds-{{uid}} .shade:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0006,transparent 55%),linear-gradient(#0006,transparent 20%)}#ds-{{uid}} .copy{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:5vw;top:35%;transition:opacity .65s}#ds-{{uid}} .copy.dim{opacity:.2}#ds-{{uid}} .dash{width:20px;height:3px;background:white;margin-bottom:18px;transform-origin:left}#ds-{{uid}} .loc,#ds-{{uid}} .line{display:block;overflow:hidden}#ds-{{uid}} .loc{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,22px);margin-bottom:14px}#ds-{{uid}} h1{font:700 clamp(52px,7.2vw,112px)/1.02 {{block.settings.display_font.family}},sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0}#ds-{{uid}} .desc{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;max-width:390px;margin:18px 0 28px;color:#fffd}#ds-{{uid}} .link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:40px;padding:0 28px;border:1px solid #ffffff8c;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em}#ds-{{uid}} .cards{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:41%;top:42%;display:flex;gap:1.9vw}#ds-{{uid}} .card{position:relative;flex:0 0 clamp(170px,14.6vw,240px);aspect-ratio:13/20;border:0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#333;color:#fff;padding:0;box-shadow:0 22px 40px #0006;transition:transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1),opacity 400ms}#ds-{{uid}} .card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#ds-{{uid}} .ct{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;padding:0 16px 20px;text-align:left}#ds-{{uid}} .ct:before{content:'';display:block;width:12px;height:2px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}#ds-{{uid}} .ct small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#fffd}#ds-{{uid}} .ct strong{font:700 21px/1.05 {{block.settings.display_font.family}},sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase}#ds-{{uid}} .controls{position:absolute;z-index:4;left:41%;right:4vw;top:91%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}#ds-{{uid}} .arrow{width:60px;height:60px;border:1px solid #ffffff8c;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:#fff;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer}#ds-{{uid}} .progress{height:1px;flex:1;background:#ffffff59;margin:0 12px}#ds-{{uid}} .progress i{display:block;height:2px;background:{{block.settings.accent}};width:0}#ds-{{uid}} .counter{font:700 48px {{block.settings.display_font.family}},sans-serif}#ds-{{uid}} .topbar{position:absolute;z-index:9;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:3px}.topbar i{display:block;width:0;height:100%;background:{{block.settings.accent}}}#ds-{{uid}} .reveal{animation:rev-{{uid}} .6s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both}@keyframes rev-{{uid}}{from{transform:translateY(105%)}to{transform:translateY(0)}}#ds-{{uid}} .fade{animation:fad-{{uid}} .6s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both}@keyframes fad-{{uid}}{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}@media(max-width:1024px) and (min-width:750px){#ds-{{uid}} .cards,#ds-{{uid}} .controls{left:46%}#ds-{{uid}} .card{flex-basis:clamp(150px,18vw,190px)}}@media(max-width:749px){#ds-{{uid}} .copy{top:18%;left:5vw}#ds-{{uid}} h1{font-size:clamp(40px,11vw,56px)}#ds-{{uid}} .desc{max-width:90%}#ds-{{uid}} .cards{left:5vw;right:0;top:auto;bottom:120px;overflow-x:auto;gap:12px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory}#ds-{{uid}} .card{flex-basis:132px;scroll-snap-align:start}#ds-{{uid}} .controls{left:5vw;right:5vw;top:auto;bottom:32px;transform:none}#ds-{{uid}} .arrow{width:48px;height:48px}#ds-{{uid}} .counter{font-size:32px}}
{% endstyle %}
<destination-motion-{{uid}} id="ds-{{uid}}" data-autoplay="{{block.settings.autoplay}}" data-seconds="{{block.settings.seconds}}" data-pause="{{block.settings.pause_hover}}" tabindex="0" {{block.shopify_attributes}}><div class="shade"></div><div class="topbar"><i></i></div><div class="copy"><div class="dash"></div><div class="loc"></div><h1><span class="line one"></span><span class="line two"></span></h1><p class="desc"></p><a class="link" href="#">DISCOVER LOCATION</a></div><div class="cards"></div><div class="controls"><button class="arrow prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><div class="progress"><i></i></div><button class="arrow next" aria-label="Next">›</button><span class="counter">01</span></div><div hidden class="data">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% liquid
assign imgkey='slide_' | append:i | append:'_image'
assign loc_key='slide_' | append:i | append:'_location'
assign one_key='slide_' | append:i | append:'_one'
assign two_key='slide_' | append:i | append:'_two'
assign desc_key='slide_' | append:i | append:'_desc'
assign url_key='slide_' | append:i | append:'_url'
assign pic=block.settings[imgkey]
%}{% if block.settings[one_key] != blank %}<i data-img="{% if pic %}{{pic | image_url: width:2400}}{% endif %}" data-card="{% if pic %}{{pic | image_url: width:600}}{% endif %}" data-loc="{{block.settings[loc_key] | escape}}" data-one="{{block.settings[one_key] | escape}}" data-two="{{block.settings[two_key] | escape}}" data-desc="{{block.settings[desc_key] | escape}}" data-url="{{block.settings[url_key]}}"></i>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></destination-motion-{{uid}}>
<script>(function(){const tag='destination-motion-{{uid}}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;customElements.define(tag,class extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.slides=[...this.querySelectorAll('.data i')];this.i=0;this.busy=false;this.elapsed=0;this.last=0;this.active=true;this.paused=false;this.render(false);this.querySelector('.next').onclick=()=>this.go(1);this.querySelector('.prev').onclick=()=>this.go(-1);this.querySelector('.cards').onclick=e=>{const c=e.target.closest('.card');if(c)this.go((+c.dataset.index-this.i+this.slides.length)%this.slides.length,c)};this.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='ArrowRight')this.go(1);if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')this.go(-1)});this.addEventListener('pointerenter',()=>{if(this.dataset.pause==='true')this.paused=true});this.addEventListener('pointerleave',()=>this.paused=false);this.addEventListener('touchstart',e=>this.touchX=e.touches[0].clientX,{passive:true});this.addEventListener('touchend',e=>{let delta=e.changedTouches[0].clientX-this.touchX;if(Math.abs(delta)>50)this.go(delta<0?1:-1)},{passive:true});document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>this.hidden=document.hidden);this.observer=new IntersectionObserver(es=>this.visible=es[0].isIntersecting);this.observer.observe(this);this.visible=true;this.raf=requestAnimationFrame(t=>this.tick(t));setTimeout(()=>this.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach((c,i)=>{c.style.animation=`cards-{{uid}} .6s ease ${i*80}ms both`}),0);this.style.setProperty('--in','1')}disconnectedCallback(){cancelAnimationFrame(this.raf);this.observer?.disconnect()}tick(t){if(this.last&&this.dataset.autoplay==='true'&&!this.paused&&!this.hidden&&this.visible&&!this.busy){this.elapsed+=t-this.last;this.querySelector('.topbar i').style.width=Math.min(100,this.elapsed/(+this.dataset.seconds*1000)*100)+'%';if(this.elapsed>=+this.dataset.seconds*1000){this.elapsed=0;this.go(1)}}this.last=t;this.raf=requestAnimationFrame(x=>this.tick(x))}go(dir,card){if(this.busy||this.slides.length<2)return;this.busy=true;this.elapsed=0;this.querySelector('.topbar i').style.width='0';let oldIndex=this.i,target=(this.i+dir+this.slides.length)%this.slides.length,slot=card||this.querySelector('.card'),r=slot?.getBoundingClientRect(),s=this.getBoundingClientRect(),old=this.querySelector('.bg'),copy=this.querySelector('.copy');this.i=target;let layer=document.createElement('img');layer.className='grow';layer.src=this.slides[target].dataset.img||'';if(r){layer.style.setProperty('--t',r.top-s.top+'px');layer.style.setProperty('--r',s.right-r.right+'px');layer.style.setProperty('--b',s.bottom-r.bottom+'px');layer.style.setProperty('--l',r.left-s.left+'px')}else{layer.style.setProperty('--t','0px');layer.style.setProperty('--r','0px');layer.style.setProperty('--b','0px');layer.style.setProperty('--l','0px')}this.appendChild(layer);if(slot){slot.style.transform='scale(1.04)';slot.style.visibility='hidden'}copy.classList.add('dim');if(old)old.style.filter='brightness(.25)';requestAnimationFrame(()=>layer.classList.add('open'));this.shift(dir);this.counter(dir);setTimeout(()=>{layer.remove();if(old)old.remove();this.render(true);this.busy=false;if(innerWidth<=749)this.querySelector('.cards').scrollTo({left:0,behavior:'smooth'})},650)}shift(dir){this.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach((c,j)=>{c.style.transitionDelay=j*80+'ms';c.style.transform=`translateX(${dir>0?-100:100}%)`;if(dir<0&&j===this.querySelectorAll('.card').length-1)c.style.opacity='0'})}counter(dir){let c=this.querySelector('.counter');c.animate([{transform:'translateY(0)'},{transform:`translateY(${dir>0?-100:100}%)`}],{duration:450,fill:'forwards'});setTimeout(()=>{c.textContent=String(this.i+1).padStart(2,'0');c.animate([{transform:`translateY(${dir>0?100:-100}%)`},{transform:'translateY(0)'}],{duration:450,fill:'forwards'})},300);this.querySelector('.progress i').style.transition='width 600ms';this.querySelector('.progress i').style.width=this.i/this.slides.length*100+'%'}render(reveal){let d=this.slides[this.i];if(!d)return;let bg=new Image();bg.className='bg';bg.src=d.dataset.img||'';bg.fetchPriority=this.i===0?'high':'auto';bg.loading=this.i===0?'eager':'lazy';bg.style.animation=reveal?'none':'bgload-{{uid}} 1.2s ease both';this.insertBefore(bg,this.querySelector('.shade'));this.querySelector('.loc').textContent=d.dataset.loc;this.querySelector('.one').textContent=d.dataset.one;this.querySelector('.two').textContent=d.dataset.two;this.querySelector('.desc').textContent=d.dataset.desc;this.querySelector('.link').href=d.dataset.url||'#';let track=this.querySelector('.cards');track.innerHTML='';for(let j=1;j<this.slides.length;j++){let ix=(this.i+j)%this.slides.length,x=this.slides[ix],b=document.createElement('button');b.className='card';b.dataset.index=ix;b.innerHTML='<img loading="lazy"><span class="ct"><small></small><strong></strong></span>';let im=b.querySelector('img');if(x.dataset.card)im.src=x.dataset.card;im.srcset=x.dataset.card+' 600w';b.querySelector('small').textContent=x.dataset.loc;b.querySelector('strong').textContent=x.dataset.one+' '+x.dataset.two;track.append(b)}this.querySelector('.counter').textContent=String(this.i+1).padStart(2,'0');this.querySelector('.progress i').style.width=this.i/this.slides.length*100+'%';if(reveal){[...this.querySelectorAll('.dash,.loc,.one,.two,.desc,.link')].forEach((x,j)=>{x.classList.remove('reveal','fade');void x.offsetWidth;x.classList.add(j<4?'reveal':'fade');x.style.animationDelay=550+j*90+'ms'})}}});})();</script>
